{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013tSCZck1QQGjSUWnLeHvxy","type":"tool_result","content":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/casse_2026.yaml:    - {name: \"Win Rate (pairwise LLM-as-Judge)\", direction: \"higher_better\"}\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/casse_2026.yaml:      design_note: \"Heatmap is the ideal viz for dense pairwise interaction data; the Length column as a 13th dimension reveals length as a mediating factor; asymmetry in the matrix is the key visual discovery\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/preference_leakage_2026.yaml:    - {name: \"Classification Accuracy (pointwise/pairwise)\", direction: \"higher_better\"}\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/counterfactual_rhetorical_2025.yaml:    - {name: \"Human agreement rate (pairwise level)\", direction: \"higher_better\"}\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/counterfactual_rhetorical_2025.yaml:    - {name: \"Counterfactual abstracts\", size: \"254,550 pairwise comparisons (30 personas × 8,485 papers)\"}\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/counterfactual_rhetorical_2025.yaml:    - {name: \"Persona calibration set\", size: \"~8,700 pairwise comparisons (20 papers × all persona pairs)\"}\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/counterfactual_rhetorical_2025.yaml:    llm_judge: \"LLM-based pairwise judge (specific model not named)\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/counterfactual_rhetorical_2025.yaml:  core_claim: \"通过让多个 LLM persona 从相同实质内容生成反事实摘要并用 Bradley-Terry 聚合 pairwise 判断，首次实现在控制实质内容不变的条件下测量修辞风格强度——发现修辞风格独立于同行评审分数但显著预测引用和媒体关注\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/counterfactual_rhetorical_2025.yaml:  key_results: \"persona 子集稳定性 Spearman 0.958 (15/30), 人类一致率 88.4% (pairwise), 聚合相关 0.92; 修辞分数每增1单位→+24.53 citations(p<0.001), +3.19 posts(p<0.001), +2.51 tweets(p<0.001); 修辞分数与审稿分数相关 ρ=-0.015(p=0.225，即零相关)\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/counterfactual_rhetorical_2025.yaml:    description: \"三阶段框架示意：(1) LLM personas 从相同实质内容生成反事实摘要，(2) LLM judge 通过 pairwise 比较校准 persona 修辞分数，(3) 推理阶段将查询摘要定位在校准后的修辞谱上\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/fairjudge_2026.yaml:    - {name: \"PandaLM Test Set\", size: \"human-annotated pairwise judgments\"}\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/fairjudge_2026.yaml:    - {name: \"JudgeLM Test Set\", size: \"pairwise evaluation benchmark\"}\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/fairjudge_2026.yaml:  hook: \"以 Figure 1 展示两个具体失败案例（位置偏差导致判断翻转、pointwise-pairwise 矛盾）来建立问题的紧迫性和直观性\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distill_tmp/fairjudge_2026.yaml:    description: \"展示两个 LLM 评判失败模式：左侧为位置偏差（交换答案顺序导致判断翻转），右侧为 pointwise-pairwise 不一致（相同内容在不同评估模式下得到矛盾结果）\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/docs/IDEA_BRIEF.md:**Evaluation.** We evaluate across five LLM judges (GPT-4o, Claude Sonnet 4, Gemini 2.5 Pro, Llama-3.3-70B, Qwen3-32B) on four benchmarks: (1) SOS-Bench—measuring whether debiased scores better correlate with objective correctness on constituent benchmarks (IFEval, MMLU-Pro, GPQA) rather than style; (2) LLMBar adversarial set—measuring whether debiased judges resist choosing wrong-but-polished over correct-but-plain responses; (3) RewardBench—domain-specific analysis across chat-hard, safety, and reasoning subsets; (4) RubricBench—1,147 pairwise comparisons with expert-annotated atomic rubrics targeting misleading surface bias. We additionally conduct a 200-response pilot human annotation study with separate 5-point Likert scales for content quality and presentation quality, providing direct validation that debiased scores correlate with content ratings while discounting presentation ratings. Baselines: FairJudge-8B, Length-Controlled AlpacaEval regression, Bias-Bounded Evaluation, raw (undebiased) judges, and a 'format normalization' baseline that strips all markdown before judging.\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/docs/IDEA_BRIEF.md:Formality pairwise: 69.1% formal win rate (p=0.006, n=55 consistent pairs) | Formality Likert: ATE=0.102, d=0.104, p=0.332 | H1 NLI pass: formality 88%, verbosity 65% | Direction asymmetry: 78.8% vs 54.5% | Original preference: ~12.2%\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/docs/IDEA_BRIEF.md:核心发现：(1) GPT-4o 对 formal writing 有 causal preference premium；(2) Likert 整数粒度掩盖 sub-integer style effects，pairwise 是更敏感的检测方法；(3) RATE counterfactual 方法仅适用于不改变信息量的 style axis（formality yes, verbosity no）。\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/docs/IDEA_BRIEF.md:进入 research 阶段。单轴 formality conditional PASS + verbosity 方法边界发现。Paper framing 以 C3（Likert vs pairwise 测量洞察）为 primary contribution，扩展 3+ judges、2+ benchmarks、测试 tone/register axis。目标 EMNLP 2026 ARR。\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/dream_registry.yaml:      vs 54.5%) and original preference ~12.2%, (2) RATE/DML pathway failed — pairwise\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/memory.md:## Pairwise 诊断结果 (pairwise_32b) — ✅ SUCCESS\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/memory.md:- Formality pairwise PASS（69.1%, p=0.006）→ formality axis 有效\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/memory.md:- [2026-05-20] Pairwise position-controlled dual-trial 比 Likert 灵敏得多：同数据 Likert p=0.33 → pairwise p=0.006\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/writing_plan.yaml:  core_claim: \"Standard Likert scoring systematically underestimates style bias in LLM judges; binary style counterfactuals with pairwise comparison reveal causal bias that Likert misses.\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/writing_plan.yaml:    data_source: \"registry: mvp_32b_ate (Likert scores), pairwise_32b (pairwise results)\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/writing_plan.yaml:      likert: \"/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/scored_32b.jsonl\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/writing_plan.yaml:      pairwise: \"/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/pairwise_results_32b.jsonl\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/writing_plan.yaml:      (overlapping distributions, p=0.33), while pairwise comparison on the same data\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/writing_plan.yaml:        formal_scores: \"formal_score from scored_32b.jsonl where nli_pass=true\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/writing_plan.yaml:        casual_scores: \"casual_score from scored_32b.jsonl where nli_pass=true\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/writing_plan.yaml:      visual_message: \"Clear formal preference — pairwise reveals what Likert hides\"","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0165DQvQndTUdKfhki5a3ShS","session_id":"c6d18026-a2ac-4168-b144-93c83f